  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fbetterdogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/c93b172f-e281-4d3c-823a-400a3f2c4287.png\" width=\"781\" height=\"130\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sqzvDFF.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"255\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本頁面亦提供獨立版本（請向下捲動）</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>使用前請閱讀<br>此資源包適用於 Minecraft 1.21.4 及以下版本，最低支援至 1.8.9。<br></strong>使用此資源包需安裝&nbsp;<strong>Optifine</strong>（Forge）或 <strong>EMF + ETF</strong>（Forge/Fabric）或 <strong>CEM + Puzzle</strong>（Fabric）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重要提示：關於 EMF + ETF 與 CEM + Puzzle，請參考下方隱藏內容中列出的必要模組。</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>註 1：在 Fabric 上使用此資源包可能會導致某些狗模型出現極輕微的錯誤。</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><br>註 2：部分基礎功能略有異常，但可透過以下方法解決：<br>要在遊戲內顯示狗的品種，請在馴服狼後／給予已馴服的狼支援的名稱標籤時，按下 <strong>F3 + T</strong>。</em>&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">___</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>讓 Better Dog 資源包在 Fabric/Sodium 上正常運作的必要模組如下。所有模組請放置於 minecraft/mods 資料夾中。</strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>重要<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">：</span></strong>請確保所有模組均與您的 Fabric 版本相容。</span></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Fabric（CEM + Puzzle（Fabric）所需）</strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>必要模組（EMF + ETF（Forge/Fabric））</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（Minecraft 版本 1.20.1 - 1.19.3）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Entity Model Features</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Entity Texture Features</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API<br><br></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>必要模組</strong> <strong>（CEM + Puzzle（Fabric））</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（Minecraft 版本 1.19.2 及以下）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重要提示！</strong> Minecraft 1.19.2 及以下版本的必要模組需進行以下設定：&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fF8e45wQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/a/F8e45wQ</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-entity-models-cem/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Custom Entity Models (CEM)</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cloth Config API</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/completeconfig/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>CompleteConfig</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Entity Texture Features</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mod Menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzle/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Puzzle</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><strong>選配（非強制，但強烈建議安裝以提升 FPS）：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithium/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithium</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Phosphor</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Sodium</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;（若遇到問題請閱讀下方說明）&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kOcFo9u.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"1301\"><br>所有品種的遊戲內截圖：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">按此處</a>&nbsp;</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YpK30pq.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"130\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yfiBnIR.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"648\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>教學 - 新增自訂名稱標籤：<br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>在本篇簡短教學中，我們將為金毛尋回犬新增自訂名稱標籤：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1) 進</strong>入 Minecraft 資源包資料夾。（%appdata% &gt; .minecraft &gt; resourcepacks）<br><br><strong>2) </strong>開啟您正在使用的 Better Dogs 資源包版本。<br><br><strong>3)&nbsp;</strong>導航至 assets/minecraft/Optifine/mob/wolf。<br><br><strong>4)&nbsp;</strong>使用 Notepad++ 或其他類似文字編輯工具開啟 <em>wolf_tame.properties&nbsp;</em>檔案。<br><br><strong>5) </strong>按下 Ctrl + F，輸入您想新增自訂名稱的品種（本範例使用 <strong><em>金毛尋回犬</em></strong>）<br><br><strong>6)&nbsp;</strong>檔案將跳轉至以下行：<br><br><em>skins.26=11 12</em><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden).*</em><br><em>weights.26=1 1<br><br></em><strong>7)</strong>&nbsp;以下這行顯示目前支援的名稱標籤：<br><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden).*</em><br><br><strong>8)&nbsp;</strong>我們現在要新增自訂名稱：Mike wazowski。我們將使用 \"&nbsp;<strong>| \"</strong> 符號將此名稱與其他名稱區隔開來：<br><br><em>skins.26=11 12</em><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden|Mike wazowski).*</em><br><em>weights.26=1 1</em><br><strong><br>9) </strong>覆蓋目前的 <em>wolf_tame.properties </em>檔案。現在即可支援自訂名稱 <em>Mike wazowski&nbsp;</em>。<br>（若您已在遊戲中修改這些檔案，請同時按下 F3 + T 以重新載入當前啟用的資源包）。<br><br><strong>注意：<br>- </strong>此教學適用於所有品種，不僅限於金毛尋回犬。<br>- 其他使用此資源包的玩家，若未執行相同步驟並加入相同名稱，則無法看到您自訂名稱對應的品種。<br><br></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">獨立版本<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dGHLWnb.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"><strong>這些獨立版本對您的 FPS 影響較小<br>（點擊下載按鈕即可下載）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-wolves/download/3694826/file\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dX1qDDo.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3511701\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZqR1DL.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3514180\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BL2vsG7.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3528488\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RJ0IpsX.png\" alt=\"Pug\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3550731\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DfJy58p.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3738097\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9jI6XTt.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3916688\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83jqNGr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3516155\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cO3jR0v.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3648293\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jDzUPmk.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ayukpXn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/download/3550731/file\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpM1xYP.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"><strong>（點擊下載按鈕即可下載）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-cats-curseforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xe1adNG.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-farm-animals\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aHEmv8l.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3536286\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c7KHrHw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pet-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I9AzCyY.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jPEH6of.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JWbz8eY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></strong>（僅適用於 Optifine）<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NDszZji.gif\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3ajCdNW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eOcnVCF.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DsCy47K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></strong></p>\n<p>逐步操作教學：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fVmO4MHx\" rel=\"nofollow\">按此處</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong>已知不相容模組列表：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Xaero's Minimap：</strong>會導致狗／狼的頭部浮空。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>與資源包相容的替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Revamped Wolf：</strong>會導致模型呈現線條狀。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>與資源包相容的替代方案：無。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Doggy Talents：</strong>會導致模型呈現線條狀。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>與資源包相容的替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-dogs-x-doggy-talents-next\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-dogs-x-doggy-talents-next</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>致謝</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">感謝&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffrancielly%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Francy_Chan</a> 製作此資源包 <strong><em>Better Dogs V1.2（附項圈）</em></strong> 版本中的項圈，並協助我解決名稱標籤相關問題。</li>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/egoist1372/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">EGOIST1372</a> 協助我解決此資源包與 Sodium-Fabric 的相容性問題。</li>\n<li>本頁面使用的自訂字型由 codeman38 製作。</li>\n<li>此資源包特殊版本所使用的音效由 Hot Ideas Inc. 與 Zapsplat 製作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>未經本人允許，請勿將此資源包上傳至任何平台。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>若您於 YouTube 影片中使用此資源包，請務必在影片描述中附上本資源包的連結。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此專案為我的興趣所在，但若您願意贊助，將不勝感激！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmrblueyetimc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1192828/description_cd73d6ea-5748-4aa7-9037-23e12d5be3c4.webp\" width=\"171\" height=\"43\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>目前與過往 Patreon 贊助者名單</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">衷心感謝所有支持者！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Heyhay13 - 雞等級</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Nqobie - 雞等級</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Rinzler - 雞等級</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><strong>以及八位慷慨的匿名贊助者</strong></strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-dogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iFbDq72.png\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></strong></strong></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/WszQzsB\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/MdEY9Xj\" alt=\"\"></p>",
